# Proposl environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# --- Client (Vite, exposed to the browser) ---
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon key>

# --- Server (/api Vercel functions; never exposed to the browser) ---
# The server reads SUPABASE_URL, falling back to VITE_SUPABASE_URL if unset
# (see api/chat.ts, api/hero-image.ts). Set at least one.
SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<service role key>
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<anthropic key>
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=<unsplash access key>

# --- Supabase edge function secrets (set via `supabase secrets set`, NOT here) ---
# These live on the Supabase project, not in this file. Listed for reference:
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY        — generate-proposal, chat-edit-proposal, generate-suggestions
#   RESEND_API_KEY           — send-proposal, submit-proposal, invite-member
#   RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET    — resend-webhook (Svix signing secret)
#   SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY — injected by the platform

# --- Local-only tooling (Claude QA + staging management; never committed) ---
# STAGING_DB_PASSWORD, STAGING_SUPABASE_URL, STAGING_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY,
# STAGING_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY live in .env.local only.
